WEBVTT

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
So what's new Mark, how

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.000
is your new job going?

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
To be honest, I can't

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
complain. I really love the

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
company that I am working

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:24.000
for.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
My coworkers are all really

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.000
friendly and helpful. They really

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.000
help me feel welcome.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.000
It's a really energetic and

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.000
fun atmosphere.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.000
My boss is hilarious, and

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.000
he's really flexible. Really

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.000
How so?

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.000
He allowed me to come

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.000
in when I want and

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.000
make my own hours.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.000
I can also leave early.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.000
If I start early, there

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.000
is no real dress code

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.000
either. I can wear jeans

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.000
and a t-shirt if I

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.000
want I can even wear

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.000
shorts in the summer. Wow

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.000
it sounds really cool. I

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.000
can't stand wearing a suit

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.000
every day which do you

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.000
prefer working late for finishing

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.000
early? I prefer finishing early,

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.000
I really enjoyed the morning.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.000
I love getting up early

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.000
and going for a run.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.000
There's nothing like watching the

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.000
sunrise while drinking my morning

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:35.000
coffee.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:41.000
Really. I am opposite. I

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.000
love sleeping in.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.000
I am most Alert in

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.000
the evenings. I'm a real

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:49.000
night owl.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Well, you know what, they

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.000
say, the early bird catches

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.000
the worm, you know, you

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.000
could be right, maybe I

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.000
will try to go to

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.000
bed a little earlier tonight.
